MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_001: Hey, Promised One! I need to talk to you about\nsomething. You're a Mediator, yeah?
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_002: <NCA>"I have the body of a Mediator, yes."
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_003: <NCB>"Did someone tell you that?"
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_004: <ACA>I knew it! You don't even flinch when you get hit\nby ordinary attacks.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_005: <ACB>Nope! I just noticed you don't even flinch when you\nget hit by ordinary attacks.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_006: You've got all the features, haven't you? Reinforced\nmuscles, high-density skeleton, and a Heart Core.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_007: They made me with lower specs than Anatolia, but\nit looks like you got all the top-of-the-line parts.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_008: The thing is, I guess I don't fully get why you were\ncreated as the perfect Mediator.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_009: <NCA>"Want to know more about Zenon's reasoning?"
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_010: Well, yeah, I guess. Especially since I wasn't built\nas well myself.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_011: I know there's no point thinking about it. But, come\non. There musta been some reason behind it.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_012: The captain always prioritized the village first,\nafter all...
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_013: Ya know, forget specs. What I wanna know is, you\nwere manufactured after me. Right?
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_014: Yeah... I get it.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_015: Hmm.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_016: Haha! That means I'm your older brother!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_017: I'm so glad I finally get to meet someone made\nafter I was!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_018: Up till now, I've always been treated like a little\nbrother! I don't gotta be called a kid anymore!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_019: Hey, can you try calling me "Big Brother" just once?\nOh! Or maybe you could call me "Big Bro"!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_020: <NCA>"Big Brother Nezha."
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_021: <NCB>"I would rather not."
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_022: <ACA>Yeah! That's great! Feels good to hear it.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_023: <ACB>What, are you embarrassed? Alright, fine, I'll let you\noff the hook this time!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_024: OK! Well then, as your big brother, I'm gonna take\ncare of you!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_025: You want a meal, or to spar, or even to go shopping,\njust holler my way any time at all!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_026: <NCA>"Then let's go shopping."
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_027: Right now? Sure! And, if you buy a bunch, I'll carry\nit all for you!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_028: Oh, that reminds me! I forgot I was told to go buy\nsome medicine. So, you've got good timing!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_A_029: ...
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_001: Heyyy! Promised One!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_002: Seriously! You made me worry!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_003: Always consult with your big brother before doing\nanything that dangerous again!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_004: <NCA>"My apologies."
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_005: You don't really understand, do you? If this was in\nKunlun, you'd be in the punishment cell!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_006: Well, I'm glad you're safe.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_007: The world's finally at peace. It wouldn't be the same\nwithout you, you know...
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_008: Argh...
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_009: Huh?!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_010: Oh, nah, don't worry. I just felt a bit dizzy.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_011: I've been kinda reckless in battles lately. I guess it's\nfinally catching up with me.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_012: After all, I don't have a Heart Core, so my insides\nare all under more strain than usual.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_013: The captain told me that at some point I'm gonna\nget real old real fast. I'll die earlier than you.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_014: <NCA>"And you still joined the battles?"
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_015: <NCB>"Were you reckless because of me?"
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_016: <ACA>Hey, it ain't like I'm gonna die right away!\nNo need to stress over your big bro.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_017: <ACB>Come on, don't make that face. No need to stress\nover your big bro.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_018: It was my own decision, and I got zero regrets.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_019: I knew what I was doing when I made my choice.\nIf we'd bring peace, it'd be a small price to pay.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_020: <NCA>"Why not get a Heart Core now?"
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_021: Even if I dug around and found one, I still wouldn't\nwant it installed.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_022: As long as I live, I'm gonna train, hone my skills,\nand keep fighting.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_023: But, you know, about my lifespan...\nI have a request.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_024: When the time comes, I want you to be there for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_025: I want you to see me when I use the last of my life.\nI want you to see I got no regrets. Can you do that?
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_026: <NCA>"I will. Promise."
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_027: Really? Wow. Thanks!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_028: If you'll be with me, then I won't be afraid.
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_029: <RSDS>Until then, I'm gonna enjoy every moment!
MID_SE_Ism_Naz_S_030: Stay with your big bro forever, yeah? I need you to\ntake care of me.